# web SPA build outputs — regenerated by `npm run build` (build:spa) and copied
# into dist/ at build time. Tracking them churned git on every rebuild; the
# published npm artifact ships the built dist/, not these. Keep the hand-authored
# static files in src/web/public (loc.html / login.html / m/ / vendor/).
src/web/public/assets/
src/web/public/index.html
src/web/public/manifest.webmanifest
src/web/public/favicon.svg
